          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger, visible political support from backer governments reduces perceived tail‑risk of spillovers and implicit credit risk for proximate developed economies, lowering risk premia and benchmark sovereign yields." />
