          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger domestic and allied political will to punish or isolate Russia leads governments to broaden and tighten export control regimes (and to coordinate allied controls), often extending scrutiny to dual‑use AI and semiconductor technologies relevant to US–China competition." />
