          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stricter US/China export controls directly block legal shipments and licensing of AI-relevant hardware, software and documentation to intermediaries and suppliers that would otherwise transfer dual-use capabilities to North Korean actors, reducing the speed and volume of technology diffusion." />
