          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tightened export controls increase compliance, screening and legal risks for banks and investors, prompting intermediaries and private financiers to reduce transactions with flagged entities or jurisdictions and thereby lowering cross-border capital flows that could finance proliferation-related activities linked to North Korea." />
