          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A measurable increase in coordinated security alignment and posture among major powers in response to North Korean nuclear developments typically entails near‑term higher defence outlays and expected sovereign issuance, putting upward pressure on benchmark sovereign yields." />
