          <attvalue for="35" value="Widening corporate spreads signal higher counterparty and funding risk, prompting correspondent banks and shipping/service providers to tighten compliance and de-risk by refusing or restricting Iran-related transactions, which effectively raises the intensity of trade and financial restrictions." />
